            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.46.2+JER.46.3+JER.46.4+JER.46.5+JER.46.6+JER.46.7+JER.46.8+JER.46.9+JER.46.10+JER.46.11+JER.46.12+JER.46.13+JER.46.14+JER.46.15+JER.46.16+JER.46.17+JER.46.18+JER.46.19+JER.46.20+JER.46.21+JER.46.22+JER.46.23+JER.46.24+JER.46.25+JER.46.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer. 46.2-26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Khu ndaalo eye khumi na chibili eye kumwesi kwe likhumi kwe kumwiiko kwe likhumi kwe mbaambe yefwe, Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi amboolela ali, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mwana wo mundu, biiya omwami owa Misiri. Muboolele nga niye ne sibala sioosi sia Misiri ne sicha khunyoola kumunaanio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rakikha khulomaloma, loma kano:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aloma ali,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khwako Omwami WELE aloma ali, “Lola ese ndareera babaandu bakhwibwaakale ne mbalu mala beere babaandu bowo ne bibiaayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne sibala sia Misiri silanjukhwa sibe sisiangalaamwe. Nio bamanye bali Ese ndi Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi sikila waloma oli, ‘Naili luli lulwase, ese samwene nalubuumba.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khwako lola, Ese nakhweanyilekho, ewe nende Naili, ndakhola sibala sia Misiri sibe sisiangalaamwe, khukhwama Mikitoli ebunaswa khukhwola khu lukoba lwa Siyene siafubo khu lwakha lwa Esopia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omundu namwe esaang'i se bilibirakhoomo tawe khu miiko kamakhumi kane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ese ndakhola sibala sia Misiri sibe sisianjuukhwe lukali khukhila bibala bioosi. Chingoba chasio chilaba alala ne chingoba chichanjukhwa khulwe kimiiko kamakhumi kane. Ndasalanisia Bamisiri mu kholo chichiindi mala mbasalanisie mu bibala bamenye mu baandu babaandi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwami WELE aloma ali, “Enyuma we kimiiko kamakhumi kane, ese khabuusie Bamisiri khukhwama mu baandu nimwo basalaanilamo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ese khakobosiele Bamisiri chikhabi chabwe, ne khubakobosia mu sibala sia Paturusi, mu sibala nimwo basaalwa, ne ebweeneyo balaba bubwami butekhele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buliba bubwami butekhele khukhila bubuundi bwoosi, mala se bukheniiniekho lundi khu kholo chichiindi tawe, ne ese khabakhole babe bakeekhe bakhalinyala lundi bamiia chikholo chichiindi tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne Baisiraeli se balieyikina lundi Bamisiri khulwe buyeeti tawe. Liiba lie Bamisiri lilikhebusia Baisiraeli nga ne bekhiikha khukhweyikina Bamisiri khulwe buyeeti. Nio Baisiraeli balimanya bali Ese ndi Omwami WELE.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omwami Nebukadinesa akhaule Misiri.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khu ndaalo eye khunyoa eye kumwesi kwe khunyoa kwe kumwiiko kukhola kamakhumi kabili na saba kie mbaambe, Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi amboolela ese ali, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mwana wo mundu, Nebukadinesa omwami owa Babiloni aakhola banamae bewe baakhola kimilimo kimiaandalafu kie khukhwibwaakala Tiro, buli murwe kwobukha sisioole, ne buli libeka liang'uukha ne kakhaba kario niye namwe banamae bewe se banyoola sisiindu siosi siosi khulwe khuruunga kimilimo kie khukhwibwaakala Tiro tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khwako Ese Omwami WELE ndoma ndi, ‘Lola Ese ndaelesia Nebukadinesa omwami owa Babiloni sibala sia Misiri, alayaaya kimiaandu kiasio mala abukule, arekukhe nakio, ne kimiaandu ekio kilaba nga kumuruungo kwe banamae bewe.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwami WELE aloma ali, “Namueleesie niye sibala sia Misiri sibe kumuruungo kwewe khulwe kimilimo nikio aakhola sikila baakholela Ese. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khu ndaalo eyo khakhole Baisiraeli babe ne kamaani mala khakhwikule kumunwa ewe Esekieli olomalome mu Baisiraeli niio buli mundu anyala akhuulila, nio bamanye bali Ese ndi Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
